WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:05.370
Hey Youtubers it’s Charlie, I hope you guys
all got a chance to see The Flash.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:09.620
I did a non-spoilery review this summer, so
this video will be top 10 moments and comic

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:10.620
book references.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.200
Don’t forget that the first episode of Arrow
Season 3 is tomorrow too.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.570
It will also be amazing.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:16.530
I’ll be doing videos for all of the DC Comics
TV Shows this fall and probably doing a few

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:20.890
random giveaways so be sure to subscribe to
get everything.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:23.869
Careful for spoilers from The Flash if you
haven’t seen it yet.

00:00:23.869 --> 00:00:28.500
I’ll wait just a sec...okay, here we go.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.640
Number 10 - John Wesley Shipp Is Barry’s
Father

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.309
This is one of the best callbacks to the old
Flash TV Show from the 90s.

00:00:37.309 --> 00:00:41.789
Not to make any puns, but that didn’t “run”
for very long but John Wesley Shipp also left

00:00:41.789 --> 00:00:45.449
a pretty big mark as the Barry Allen version
of the Flash.

00:00:45.449 --> 00:00:50.219
Even his co-star, Amanda Pays has been cast
on the new Flash show.

00:00:50.219 --> 00:00:52.561
She’s playing the same character as she
did in the classic series.

00:00:52.561 --> 00:00:54.659
Doctor Tina McGee of STAR Labs.

00:00:54.659 --> 00:00:59.889
It’s just really awesome of the producers
to include the classic cast in a big way.

00:00:59.889 --> 00:01:02.559
John Wesley Shipp will mostly be stuck in
Iron Heights, but he does have a recurring

00:01:02.559 --> 00:01:03.559
role.

00:01:03.559 --> 00:01:04.559
So we will see him a couple more times this
season.

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:05.559
I don’t know if they’re going to give
him any action scenes, but he’s in Iron

00:01:05.559 --> 00:01:07.160
Heights Prison, where they stick all the super
criminals they capture.

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.430
So he might get to punch someone in the face
at some point.

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:12.860
Number 9 - Professor Zoom Tease At The Top
of the Episode

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:18.800
Right away they come out and say yes, here
is the biggest villain The Flash has ever

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:19.800
had.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:23.440
Just for reference, during the TCAs, Greg
Berlanti and Andrew Kriesberg said that the

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:26.990
Reverse Flash here would start to manifest
himself early in the season, so expect to

00:01:26.990 --> 00:01:29.230
see more Professor Zoom after the first couple
of episodes.

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:32.280
I’d say at least by episode 5 or 6.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:34.410
In time to set something up for the Mid-Season
finale.

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:38.580
Yes, I do think that Professor Zoom will appear
in the mid-season finale.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:43.220
Even though the title of that is Arrow versus
Flash and the second half is called The Brave

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:44.220
and the Bold.

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:53.860
I feel like mid-season finale’s are bookmarked
for Big Villain reveals

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:57.530
Number 8 - The CSI Procedural Structure to
the Show

00:01:57.530 --> 00:02:03.640
The Flash is an origin story for a whole lot
of comic book characters, so it naturally

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:05.280
lends itself to the process of discovery.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:07.760
By doing a superhero CSI type show, you can
get into all the really cool science of super

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:08.760
powers.

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:09.760
And The Flash will be doing Superpowers.

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:11.099
STAR Labs is The Flash’s Version of the
Arrow Cave, and it’s a cutting edge research

00:02:11.099 --> 00:02:12.099
facility.

00:02:12.099 --> 00:02:16.870
I don’t think they’ll get too hardcore
with exposition, this is the CW after all.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:19.129
It’s more about the characters than the
powers.

00:02:19.129 --> 00:02:22.209
But the big tease is the map here on the screen.

00:02:22.209 --> 00:02:26.150
All these pockets of energy will be creating
new super villains and super heroes.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:29.940
I’ll talk more about them as they show up
in episodes.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:33.810
The next big one is episode 3.

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.390
Number 7 - Barry’s Mystery Board

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:41.689
This is one of the big plots for season 1,
solving the mystery of what really happened

00:02:41.689 --> 00:02:43.650
the night his mother was murdered.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:47.939
During that same TCAs panel I mentioned, the
producers said they would stay really faithful

00:02:47.939 --> 00:02:49.829
to the general arc of Flash Rebirth.

00:02:49.829 --> 00:02:53.640
That’s the comic that Geoff Johns used to
bring Barry Allen back from the dead.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:03:01.739
You should definitely read it, it’s really
good.

00:03:01.739 --> 00:03:04.389
The Murder Mystery gets tied up with the big
villain arc in this really nice way.

00:03:04.389 --> 00:03:05.389
So

00:03:05.389 --> 00:03:07.939
Because a lot of people haven’t read that
comic book please use spoiler tags when talking

00:03:07.939 --> 00:03:08.939
about the plot.

00:03:08.939 --> 00:03:10.440
Number 6 - The Gorilla Grodd Teaser

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:14.510
There hasn’t been any confirmation that
Grodd is going to be in season 1.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:18.230
Greg Berlanti said he actually had to argue
with the network to keep the easter egg in

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:21.730
there.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:25.440
But they are planning things so they can do
Grodd eventually.

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:30.819
Nothing is off the table in terms of Flash
characters.

00:03:30.819 --> 00:03:33.680
They even said that they’d be doing Wally
West at some point.

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:34.680
Not This season, but you get the idea.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:35.680
The Grodd thing isn’t a teaser for this
season, it was intended more as a wink to

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:36.680
the fans.

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:37.680
But it will probably turn into something in
a future season.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.680
Number 5 - Ferris Air

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:43.560
I know everyone wants to know when Green Lantern
is coming on but if they did bring him into

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:47.500
the tv show universe, it would be through
Arrow first.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:51.840
It’s really the test bed for things that
big.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:55.190
But yes, they have said they’re open to
Hal Jordan someday.

00:03:55.190 --> 00:04:00.290
There’s not really room for him this season,
but there’s nothing saying they couldn’t

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:02.730
let him cameo in a future season.

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:07.680
Or even Carol Ferris for that matter.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.749
Star Sapphire’s for the win!

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:15.900
Number 5 - Caitlin Snow’s Career and her
Fiance were killed in the blast

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:26.680
Caitlin Snow is Killer Frost in the comics,
so it’s possible on the show danielle could

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:37.900
have powers and just not be telling them about
it.

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:42.310
Her Fiancee that supposedly died is Ronnie
Raymond aka Firestorm.

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:44.580
He’s being played by Robbie Amell on the
show.

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:49.180
We’ll meet him for the first time in Episode
3 or 4 I believe.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.680
But he will become Firestorm.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:55.340
Robbie Amell has been tweeting pictures from
the set and it looks pretty cool.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:05:02.390
Number 4 - Clyde Mardon becomes the first
of the Rogues

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:06.980
Weather Wizard is just the first of many Rogues
that will be on the series.

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:14.020
They even posted the first official picture
of Wentworth Miller as Captain Cold.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:19.590
I’m hoping that by the end of the season
they actually team up and call themselves

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:20.680
The Rogues.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:25.280
For those wondering, at the end of the episode
he’s being transferred to Iron Heights.

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:27.430
Eventually that’s going to turn into their
Arkham Asylum.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.500
Feel free to make any Prison Break jokes you
want.

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:38.860
Because there are a lot of Prison Break actors
playing Rogues.

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:40.050
Number 3 - Detective Pretty Boy

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:47.420
They named him Edward Thawne, which is a play
on Eobard Thawne, Professor Zoom.

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:51.670
It’s pretty clear he’s normal in the episode.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:55.280
But it’s possible that they named him like
Professor Zoom, but they’ll give him the

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:57.970
storyline from Hunter Zolomon in the comics.

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:01.550
Hunter Zolomon works at the police station
and shares some of the exhibited qualities

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:04.740
of Rick Cosnett in this episode.

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:06.710
There are a lot of directions they could go
with his character.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:07.710
But he did not attend any of the press tour
events.

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:09.990
Probably because he’s going to get tied
up in the big villain arc this season.

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:11.120
Number 2 - The Stephen Amell Cameo

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:14.610
This is a good teaser for the shared universe
that Arrow and the Flash will have this season.

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:18.800
Actors will only cross over to each show a
few times, the mid season finale of both shows

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.650
will be a two hour crossover event.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:23.444
Felicity will be the next person to crossover
in the fourth episode I think.

00:06:23.444 --> 00:06:24.444
Number 1 - The Newspaper

00:06:24.444 --> 00:06:27.660
The Harrison Well future newspaper thing could
mean a lot.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:31.660
He could be Professor Zoom, he could be a
future version of Barry Allen, or he could

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.210
be one of the other reverse flashes.

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:38.440
The big easter egg was the Queen Industries,
Wayne Tech merger.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:40.340
That’s not intended to be anything special.

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:42.210
It’s just like the gorilla grodd thing.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.440
They just wanted to have some fun with the
fandom.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:49.090
They’re not teasing an infinite crisis storyline
or anything either.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:55.500
But Harrison Wells is someone we need to keep
our eyes on.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:59.510
Let me know what your favorite moment was,
it’s going to be an amazing season.

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:08.210
I will do as many bonus videos as possible
for both Arrow and The Flash, Arrow is tomorrow

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:13.450
and thursday I’ll do a shared Q&amp;A for both
shows.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:21.090
For those asking, you don’t absolutely have
to watch both Arrow and the Flash to understand

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:34.130
the other show, but it will make it a lot
more fun if you do.

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:35.130
So you should.

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:39.180
Right now click here for my Flash Review and
click here to start getting ready for Arrow

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.180
Season 3.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.452
Thanks for watching, everybody high five and
I’ll see you tonight!

